Adaptation_method:
Before:
const {stdout} = await execa('node', ['file.js'], {encoding: 'buffer'});
console.log(Buffer.isBuffer(stdout)); // true

After:
const {stdout} = await execa('node', ['file.js'], {encoding: 'buffer'});
console.log(stdout instanceof Uint8Array); // true
// If Buffer is needed:
const buffer = Buffer.from(stdout);

Note: The same applies to execaSync(). Also, remove any use of 'encoding: null', as it is no longer supported.
